    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d244">

                <pb facs="0375" n="293" xml:id="pg293"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.151/50: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Whitehouse</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-07-20T11:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                                1925—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 20—9:14
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>389. Your 278, July 18, 2 p.m.<anchor n="7" xml:id="d244-f1"/> The French
                    Government last week officially but orally informed the Greek Chargé d’Affaires
                    that it consented to the waterworks loan subject to the priority of the Greek
                    share of the Ottoman public debt.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitehouse</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
